{
  "how_this_works": [
    "Everything you see around Ember that isn't a building. Edit it in builder mode (World tab) or by hand.",
    "roof: the platform Ember lives on. size is its width (the roof spans -size/2 to size/2).",
    "tower: the skyscraper under the roof. city: the towers all around (change seed for a different city).",
    "signs and props: free-standing neon signs and decorations. pos is [x, height, z]; they can float. The roof clutter is made in Blender (blender/rooftop.py); \"autofit\": false keeps a model at its real size.",
    "sky: background, fog, light, glow (bloom) and exposure (overall brightness)."
